{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Change the sentence for rape to a mandatory life sentence",
        "additional_details": "We believe current sentencing is clearly too lenient on people who can cause severe mental health issues that can lead to death, the same eventual consequence that murder has - and murder has a mandatory life sentence. We feel it's genuinely a disappointment that the legal system can allow such a severe crime to be punished by something less than a mandatory life sentence.",
        "background": "We believe the punishment for rapists is not nearly harsh enough and a mandatory life sentence is the only way to protect the public from them and to prevent repeat offences.",
